    // Task 212 (owner, 18 Oct): Kong Comic Book, a second Workshop download; its page can switch on the mod it recommends.
    {"Comic Book Texture Pack", "Comic Book Texture Pack", "Comic Book Texture Pack", "Comic Book Texture Pack", "Comic Book Texture Pack"},
    {"A comic book style texture pack for King Kong. We recommend also enabling the Cel shading mod.", "Ein Texturpaket im Comicstil für King Kong. Wir empfehlen, zusätzlich die Mod Cel Shading zu aktivieren.", "Un paquete de texturas de estilo cómic para King Kong. Recomendamos activar también el mod Cel shading.", "Un pack de textures style bande dessinée pour King Kong. Nous recommandons d'activer aussi le mod Cel shading.", "Un pacchetto texture in stile fumetto per King Kong. Consigliamo di attivare anche la mod Cel shading."},
